<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 13.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 13.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 13     Sept 12	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.940     240.690     237,040    1.65 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.500     301.500     303.640   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.320     159.330     165.490   -3.73 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.662	46.660	48.410   -3.61 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  374.880     374.560     366.280    2.35 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.170     142.135     147.886   -3.87 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.773	15.789	14.975    5.33 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.520     218.890     230.135   -5.05 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.888	 1.887	 1.939   -2.63 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.558	 1.556	 1.575   -1.08 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  194.580     195.030     206.030   -5.56 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
